<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  RM_SumpFaunaItems.xml                     RM_TheSump · SUMP_FAUNA_ROSTER_1
  ============================================================================
  Harvested goods for ../ThingDefs_Races/RM_SumpFauna.xml, this same pass:
  gulveth's waterproof hide, the thrummel family's chitin+seepwax economy
  (sheet §7), dredgel's chitin, skarrid's prized black leather, and
  skellarn's spine-leg chitin.

  🔑 RM_Seepwax is a SEPARATE def from the pre-existing RUT_ThrummelSeepwax
  (src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Defs/ThingDefs_Items/RUT_Tarred_Solvents.xml,
  built under SUMP_TAR_NASTINESS_1, "doing" as of this pass). That def's own
  header explicitly defers "the thrummel creature/hive itself... awaiting its
  real source, the hive raid" to this roster — but it lives in the Utinni
  CAMPAIGN layer, and RM_TheSump (this mod) may not depend on it: the free
  mod must stand rich alone (Q11a), and RM tier never depends on RUT tier.
  So the thrummel family's own butcherProducts here reference this file's own
  RM_Seepwax/RM_ThrummelChitin instead. Reconciling the two economies (e.g. a
  campaign-side raid-loot PatchOperation that also awards RUT_ThrummelSeepwax)
  is follow-on work for whoever next picks up SUMP_TAR_NASTINESS_1 or the
  Utinni layer wiring — not this item's scope.

  Zero new art needed for any of these six: LeatherBase/WoolBase children
  omit texPath and inherit the parent's own default stuff icon, tinted via
  <color> — same shipped, already-clean pattern this mod's own
  RM_MushroomLeather (TheRot) and RM_SweetlineWool (LeaningScrub) use.
  ResourceBase children (chitin, wax) reuse core-guaranteed vanilla icons
  (Things/Item/Resource/Leather, /Chemfuel) recolored via Graphic_StackCount —
  the exact same reuse this repo's own RM_ScaldWalkerChitin
  (DivingInteraction) already ships. No DEPLOY_HOLD needed for this file.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="LeatherBase">
    <defName>RM_Leather_TarCured</defName>
    <label>tar-cured hide</label>
    <description>A gulveth's hide, cured waterproof by a lifetime half-sunk in the black. The Sump's own coat — nothing else on the planet sheds tar the way clothing cut from this does.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <color>(28, 26, 24)</color>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>4.2</MarketValue>
      <DeteriorationRate>1.5</DeteriorationRate>
      <Mass>0.04</Mass>
      <Flammability>0.7</Flammability>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>0.35</StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Blunt>0.3</StuffPower_Armor_Blunt>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>28</StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>10</StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>
    </statBases>
    <stuffProps>
      <color>(28, 26, 24)</color>
      <commonality>0.6</commonality>
    </stuffProps>
  </ThingDef>

